<title>BELGIUM: Solvay sets 1997 results release dates.</title>
<headline>Solvay sets 1997 results release dates.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian chemicals, plastics and drugs group Solvay set the following dates for 1997 news releases:</p>
<p>- February 6: provisional 1996 results</p>
<p>- March 27: final 1996 results and dividend.</p>
<p>- June 5: annual shareholders meeting</p>
<p>- June 11: dividend payment</p>
<p>- July 31: first-half 1997 results</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
